## 1. Elixir: tensor EXLA s32 [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
Nx.to_pointer -> address 0xAC8F8C6C0, data_size 20
$ lldb --batch -p 1494 -o "memory read --format d --size 4 --count 5 0xAC8F8C6C0"
  (lldb) process attach --pid 1494
  (lldb) memory read --format d --size 4 --count 5 0xAC8F8C6C0
  0xac8f8c6c0: 1
  0xac8f8c6c4: 2
  0xac8f8c6c8: 3
  0xac8f8c6cc: 4
  0xac8f8c6d0: 5
  (lldb) process detach

